WEBVTT

00:00:00.097 --> 00:00:06.488
Open the video part's settings. Each tab changes this part of the reel.

00:00:06.488 --> 00:00:18.175
On the Frame tab, zoom in to tighten the framing. The Adjust tab holds light and color.

00:00:18.175 --> 00:00:27.533
Play the part to see the closer framing in motion, then open its settings again.
